3.3 Integer seeds and the theorem
Lemma 3.4 (Seed realization). Every positive integer pair (u, w) ∈ (Zr
>0)2
is realized by disjoint algebraically independent incoming leading tuples.
Proof. Use independent variables X1, . . . , Xr, Y1, . . . , Yr and set
Qi = Xui
