and transformed membership rows advance the typed inverse state to the
next edge. Induction in the W-first, V -second inverse order therefore proves
reciprocity at every phase and prefix.
Conversely, phase-resolved equality for all integer seeds gives the first
linear identity in (6.4) on Uek
